    "helper_counting": "All browser renderer/gpu/network helpers are classified as browser and counted. The frozen yt-dlp PyInstaller binary runs as two processes with the same yt-dlp executable name (bootloader plus embedded CPython); both are counted as yt_dlp, so the embedded interpreter is represented by that count rather than a separate python-named process. yt-dlp's ffmpeg/ffprobe sidecars are counted as media and the JavaScript runtime (Bun or quickjs) is counted in its own category. Counts are maximum simultaneous processes per phase category, and the final cleanup samples expose any post-shutdown residue. Memory numbers are simultaneous sums at one sampled instant, never sums of per-process maxima.",
